            <p>A Cozumel cruise is usually the high point of Western Caribbean itineraries. The water grows brilliant turquoise as your ship nears the island. Well-known for its coral reefs and marine life, Cozumel is a popular destination for snorkelling and scuba diving enthusiasts. Even from the deck, the water is remarkably clear. </p>

            <p>Beyond its shores, Cozumel boasts a rich cultural history and warm hospitality. Visitors can tour Mayan ruins, wander through local markets or lounge at beach clubs overlooking the Caribbean Sea. One of the best ways to enjoy a day in Cozumel is with a Cozumel cruise, where travellers can combine both adventure and relaxation on multiple levels while still having the option to explore at their own pace. </p>

